      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Entonces Māui se transformó en un halcón, el kāhu, y voló tan rápido como pudo.",
          "en": "So Māui changed himself into a hawk, the kāhu, and flew as fast as his wings could carry him."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero el fuego lo seguía, y casi lo alcanzaba en el aire.",
          "en": "But the fire chased him, and almost caught him in the air."
        },
        {
          "es": "Se lanzó a un estanque. Pero el agua estaba casi hirviendo.",
          "en": "He dived into a pool of water. But even the water was almost boiling."
        },
        {
          "es": "Ardían los bosques. Ardían la tierra y el mar. No había dónde posarse.",
          "en": "The forests were burning. The land and the sea were burning. There was nowhere to land."
        },
        {
          "es": "¿Tú te habrías detenido después de la primera llama?",
