      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Māui llamó a sus antepasados: Tāwhirimātea, el dios de los vientos, y Whatitiri, el trueno.",
          "en": "Māui called on his ancestors: Tāwhirimātea, god of the winds, and Whatitiri, the thunder."
        },
        {
          "es": "«¡Denme agua! ¡Agua para apagar este fuego que me persigue!»",
          "en": "'Give me water! Water to quench this fire that is chasing me!'"
        },
        {
          "es": "Llegaron ráfagas y vendavales, y cayó una lluvia fuerte y larga.",
          "en": "Squalls and gales came rushing in, and a heavy, lasting rain poured down."
        },
        {
          "es": "El fuego se apagó. Y Mahuika casi muere bajo la lluvia, gritando como antes había gritado Māui.",
          "en": "The fire went out. And Mahuika almost perished in the rain, shrieking as Māui had shrieked before."
        }
