        },
        {
          "es": "Cuando Māui volvió, sus padres le dijeron: «Te advertimos. Le hiciste trampa a tu antepasada.»",
          "en": "When Māui came home, his parents said: 'We warned you. You played tricks on your ancestress.'"
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero Māui no pensaba cambiar. Y su padre le advirtió que eso terminaría mal.",
          "en": "But Māui had no plans to change. And his father warned him that it would end badly."
        },
        {
          "es": "¿Māui fue un héroe o solo un tramposo con suerte? Cuéntanos en los comentarios.",
          "en": "Was Māui a hero, or just a lucky trickster? Tell us in the comments."
